{"_type":"item","id":"019dc0559fa770c8b69c2488d69caf37","type":"work_item","status":"done","title":"Schema: common annotation data model + 2D primitives + kind discriminator","created_at":"2026-04-24T16:32:10","updated_at":"2026-04-25T19:00:11","tags":["annotations","schema"],"parent":"minerva:019dc054c4167872b9cc767d9a4e25dd","resolution":"Shipped in Phase 1B Round 1-2. AnnotationSchema.gd implements common data model + 2D primitives + kind discriminator + validation. Tests in test_annotation_substrate.gd (139 assertions)."}
