{"_type":"item","id":"019dc0bb56967f53b5a9220dbb122bc5","type":"work_item","status":"done","title":"[SUPERSEDED] Register cad_3d_plane annotation kind via platform substrate","description":"Authored 2026-04-24 before the substrate landed and before the plugin was built. The kind we actually shipped is `cad_edge_number` (registered locally in `CADPanel.gd:184-186` via `AnnotationRegistry.register_annotation_kind`), not `cad_3d_plane`. The substrate-side adoption work this ticket implied is broken out into Phase A (substrate consumer) and Phase B (edge anchors) below. Closing as superseded.","created_at":"2026-04-24T18:23:16","updated_at":"2026-05-02T17:25:22","tags":["annotations","cad"],"parent":"minerva:019dc0552d6a774dae54e01190e0029f","resolution":"Superseded. Authored 2026-04-24 before substrate landed; the kind that actually shipped is cad_edge_number, not cad_3d_plane. Substrate-side adoption work this implied is replaced by Phase A1 (019de9b755b07366), Phase A3 (019de9b7ae707aa0), and Phase B1 (019de9b807e67c01)."}
