{"_type":"item","id":"019dc0bbd6937264880b1327c942d5b6","type":"dcr","status":"proposed","title":"Presentation plugin: PowerPoint-style slide authoring + fullscreen presenting","description":"Consumer of the plugin platform (DCR-1) and annotation substrate (DCR-2). Surfaces new platform capabilities that DCR-1 and DCR-2 must accommodate: (1) fullscreen / exclusive-input mode (plugin takes over the window for presenting, claims keyboard shortcuts, ESC releases), (2) multi-window plugin support for presenter view (primary = audience view, secondary = current + next + notes + timer), (3) ink_stroke primitive in the core annotation primitive set (broadly useful beyond presentations), (4) high-frequency live annotation authoring path (pen strokes at 60+Hz, batched writes). Reveal sequencing is plugin-internal (presentation holds a reveal script mapping slide + step → annotation IDs); the core annotation substrate stays positional/stateless. v1 feature set: slide types (title/section/main), tile layouts, mixed image/outline content, fullscreen mode with next/prev/start-from-here/exit, step-based annotation reveal on next-press, pen-drawn live annotations. Post-v1: PPTX import, PDF export, slide transitions, auto-advance, speaker-notes rendering.","created_at":"2026-04-24T18:23:48","updated_at":"2026-04-24T18:23:48","priority":3,"tags":["annotations","plugin","presentation"]}
{"_type":"item","id":"019dc0bbfcc57d81b4ac1300d4923094","type":"work_item","status":"backlog","title":"Plan: Presentation Plugin (v1)","description":"Sequenced tasks below. Depends on platform work in DCR-1 (fullscreen + multi-window plugin capabilities) and DCR-2 (ink_stroke primitive + live-authoring API). Tasks linked as children of this plan.","created_at":"2026-04-24T18:23:58","updated_at":"2026-04-24T18:23:58","tags":["plan","presentation"],"parent":"minerva:019dc0bbd6937264880b1327c942d5b6"}
