{"_type":"event","item_id":"019de0cfcb4870ab93680c2e6037cb69","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-01T00:09:32","note":"in_progress → done. core/canvas.point anchor added: validator + summary in CoreAnchors._CanvasPointResolver, helper CoreAnchors.make_canvas_point(x, y). AnnotationHost.resolve_anchor short-circuits canvas.point to fresh substrate-owned position resolution (never stale). New AnnotationHost.resolve_position_source(source) accepts Vector2, [x,y], {x,y}, or anchor envelope; returns null only when there is genuinely no signal (no resolver registered AND no snapshot position). Stale anchors with snapshot positions still return the snapshot position so kinds can render broken endpoints in place. Test coverage: 10 dedicated tests in test_overlay_canvas.gd. core_anchors known-count test updated 4→5 to include canvas.point."}
