{"_type":"event","item_id":"019de0cfec09758caa07efbfb1459c35","seq":4,"event_type":"transition","actor":"agent","timestamp":"2026-05-01T00:36:02","note":"in_progress → done. Arrow kind enhanced with kind_payload.endpoint_a/endpoint_b paths. Each endpoint is a position source resolved via ctx.host.resolve_position_source — supports all 3 modes: anchor↔anchor, anchor↔free, free↔free. head_size + head_style (single/double/none) honored. Legacy primitives path intact (falls back when payload fields absent). Tests in test/annotations_v2/test_overlay_kinds.gd cover all 3 modes, bounds, hit-test, stale-anchor snapshot fallback, sidecar JSON round-trip. Authoring UX (click-to-place tool) deferred to canvas-sync follow-up."}
